'''Squirrels Heath''' (from 2002 to 2022 '''Squirrel's Heath''') is an electoral ward in the [[London Borough of Havering]]. The ward was first used in the [[2002 London local elections|2002 elections]]. It returns councillors to [[Havering London Borough Council]].

